    "If you've ever checked into a Marriott property and immediately felt that ahh, I'm on a trip sense of calm, that's not an accident — it's scent marketing at work. But here's the thing most get-the-hotel-smell articles gloss over: Marriott isn't one hotel. It's a portfolio of more than 30 brands, from Courtyard to the Ritz-Carlton, and scent programs vary by property and brand tier rather than running off one single fixed formula company-wide. What is consistent is the feeling those programs are built to create, so that's what this guide focuses on recreating.",
